  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia Will Rise Again Diaspora Engagement Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Liberian Diaspora Engagement Program will involve:  (a) Developing networking and coordination capacity of the Diaspora Affairs Unit within the Ministry of State. Activities under this component are (i)Strengthening the communication and network coordination capacity of the Diaspora Unit; (ii)Developing data generation, management and application capacity with MoS Diaspora Unit; (iii)Developing Liberian Diaspora consultative strategies. (b) Designing Diaspora Strategic Framework (National Liberian Diaspora Policy) and Plan of Action, with specific focus on the education sector as a pilot. The activities include (i)Strengthening MoS Diaspora Unit and policymaker&apos;s knowledge about the AU Diaspora strategy and global and regional best practices in the education sector; (ii) Preparing four analytical papers on National Diaspora engagement and produce a comprehensive National Liberia Diaspora Policy Framework, Plan of Action and benchmarks for capacity development in the education sector.</narrative>
  </description>
